## Model card

- **Name:** Mistral Small 4
- **Short description:** Mistral's fast production model (released 2026-03-16) for chat, extraction and cost-sensitive agents.
- **Provider / access:** Mistral AI (`mistral-small-2603`), plus ~14 routes. Open weights.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-03-16; knowledge cutoff 2025-06 (models.dev).
- **IDs:** `mistral-small-4`, `mistralai/mistral-small-2603`.
- **Context window:** 262,144 tokens; max output 256,000.
- **Modalities:** text, image and PDF in; text out; tool calls and reasoning.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11/12):** $0.15 / $0.60 per 1M input/output; cache read $0.015.
- **Architecture:** open-weight (Mistral; undisclosed size).

